    {
      "timestamp": "09:35:40",
      "index": 19,
      "pageno": 2,
      "identity": "45",
      "text": "Could you please explain to us, what is a hedge? What"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:35:45",
      "index": 20,
      "pageno": 2,
      "identity": "46",
      "text": "is the purpose of a hedge?"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:35:48",
      "index": 21,
      "pageno": 2,
      "identity": "47",
      "text": "A So in general terms, a hedge is a contract by which"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:35:55",
      "index": 22,
      "pageno": 2,
      "identity": "48",
      "text": "a company, any company, can lock in the margin between"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:36:00",
      "index": 23,
      "pageno": 2,
      "identity": "49",
      "text": "the purchase and the sales leg of a specific"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:36:03",
      "index": 24,
      "pageno": 2,
      "identity": "50",
      "text": "transaction, in case either leg has a different price"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:36:09",
      "index": 0,
      "pageno": 3,
      "identity": "51",
      "text": "nature from the other. So the hedge helps in"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:36:13",
      "index": 1,
      "pageno": 3,
      "identity": "52",
      "text": "eliminating this difference and locking in the margin"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:36:15",
      "index": 2,
      "pageno": 3,
      "identity": "53",
      "text": "of the transaction."
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "09:36:20",
      "index": 3,
      "pageno": 3,
      "identity": "54",
      "text": "Q What is the hedging policy of PPD?"
    }
  ],
